<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<!--Driver Code Ends-->

<style>
div {
  width: 200px;
  height: 40px;
  border: 1px solid black;
  overflow: auto;
}
</style>

<!--Driver Code Starts-->
</head>
<body>

<div>
  This is an example of CSS overflow. When the content inside the box is too long to fit, a scrollbar appears to let you see the rest.
</div>

